  "details": "Hello Devs,\n\nWhen streaming and using the fly button to move the camera, it's really easy to hit the 'Spout' button by accident, cutting the video feed on stream. This also ruins filming in VR, because you can scupper an entire scene by accidentally clicking the wrong thing. \n\nSpout is an excellent feature for streamers and videographers, so to avoid this issue, could you please move this button a couple of lines along, please?\n\nThank you :)",
